<LegalLayout
  title="Jurisdictions"
  description="How Trackwise services are offered in each country and the legal basis on which they are provided."
  eyebrow="Legal"
  effective="2026-05-17"
  lastUpdated="2026-05-17"
>
  <p>
    Trackwise services depend on jurisdiction. This page describes how each
    market is supported. <strong>Trackwise's FinCEN MSB registration is not
    a license to transmit money in any U.S. state.</strong> Where money
    transmission is required, services are provided through licensed banking
    or payment partners.
  </p>

  <h2>Supported markets</h2>
  <p>
    Specific partner relationships are disclosed under NDA during commercial
    discussions. The descriptions below reflect the legal basis on which
    Trackwise offers services and may be updated as our partner network
    evolves.
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>United States.</strong> Trackwise LLC, Wyoming. Federally
      registered with FinCEN as an MSB (#31000299058422). State money-
      transmission services, where required, are provided through licensed
      partner institutions. Trackwise does not hold state MTL licenses
      directly.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Mexico.</strong> Services offered in cooperation with locally
      authorized partners under CNBV and Banco de México oversight. Trackwise
      does not hold a Mexican fintech license directly.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Brazil.</strong> Services offered through Banco Central do
      Brasil-authorized payment institutions and acquirers.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Colombia.</strong> Services offered in cooperation with locally
      licensed entities under SFC oversight.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Spain (EU).</strong> EU-area services offered through SEPA and
      partner EMIs. Trackwise is not directly authorized by the Banco de España.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Canada.</strong> Services offered through Canadian partners
      registered with FINTRAC; Trackwise's own FINTRAC registration status
      will be disclosed when applicable.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Honduras, Guatemala, Ecuador.</strong> Limited availability
      through partner remittance and payment networks. Subject to enhanced
      due diligence and may be unavailable for some use cases.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Excluded jurisdictions</h2>
  <p>
    Trackwise does not provide services to persons or entities located in,
    organized under the laws of, or ordinarily resident in jurisdictions
    subject to comprehensive U.S. sanctions, or on the FATF call-for-action
    list.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For coverage and partner information, contact{' '}
    <a href="mailto:hello@trackwise.finance">hello@trackwise.finance</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
